It is a bug :-)

There is a function in NetHack which converts a given item into a
readable string. This function is used to convert for example your
"]" into a "blessed +3 scale mail". If it cannot identify the
given object it names it: "glorkum". So it is not a gem, amulet, potion
scroll, armor, weapon, food, rock or statue. Apperently it was trying
to name the vertical or horizontal wall you kicked against.
